                  "description": "Check if the given path can be resolved before publishing."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "lifetime",
                  "value": "24h",
                  "description": "Time duration that the record will be valid for.\nThis accepts durations such as \"300s\", \"1.5h\" or \"2h45m\". Valid time units are\n\"ns\", \"us\" (or \"µs\"), \"ms\", \"s\", \"m\", \"h\"."
